</div>
  </div>

  </div>


      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="paragraph--type--list">
      <div class="hero--max-width">
      <div class="container l-flex col">
        <div class="number-image l-flex row ">
          <div class="h1-xl number has-image scroll-reveal animate-pseudo-el">
            <span class="animate-fallback animate-fade-in">
  03
</span>
          </div>
          <div class="image">
  
        
  <figure class="media media-image carousel-slide ma-0 carousel-slide--view-mode media-caption media-location">

    <div class="square-aspect"></div>
      
    <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large_horizontal_wide/public/river_street_cobblestones.jpg.webp?h=56d0ca2e&amp;itok=vP1XKNS4" width="1200" height="675" alt="river_street_cobblestones.jpg" class="image-style-large-horizontal-wide scale-with-grid" />




          <figcaption class="caption-basic text-align-right z-2">
          <span class="field--text-long">
    <p>Allow these historic cobblestones to lead you on an adventure.</p>
  </span>

      </figcaption>
    
  </figure>


                        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
        <div class="body--max-width">
      <div class="container title-body l-flex col">
        <h2 class="title">
  Shopping
</h2>
        <div class="body">  <span class="field--text-long">
    <p>If you’re looking to buy a Savannah souvenir, River Street is the place to do it. Stop by one of River Street’s classic shops, like <a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="93949242-e87e-45a7-88f0-b936c171c6aa" href="/profile/bobs-your-uncle-fannies-your-aunt/5439" title="Bob's Your Uncle - Fannie's Your Aunt">Bob’s Your Uncle – Fannie’s Your Aunt</a>, The Cinnamon Bear Store or Gallery 209. There’s also an <a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="86a88ea8-3e38-4bdc-97d2-65a4a5067de5" href="/profile/river-street-market-landing/4258" title="River Street Market Landing">old-fashioned open-air market</a> on River Street, so you can enjoy the fresh air and river breeze while you shop.</p>

  </span>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
      
</div>

  <div class="paragraph--type--list">
      <div class="hero--max-width">
      <div class="container l-flex col">
        <div class="number-image l-flex row ">
          <div class="h1-xl number has-image scroll-reveal animate-pseudo-el">
            <span class="animate-fallback animate-fade-in">
  04
</span>
          </div>
          <div class="image">
  
        
  <figure class="media media-image carousel-slide ma-0 carousel-slide--view-mode media-caption media-location">

    <div class="square-aspect"></div>
      
    <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large_horizontal_wide/public/2024-02/broken%20keel%20restaurant.jpg.webp?h=96a96008&amp;itok=0mhoi5Wv" width="1200" height="675" alt="Broken Keel" class="image-style-large-horizontal-wide scale-with-grid" />




          <figcaption class="caption-basic text-align-right z-2">
          <span class="field--text-long">
    <p>Broken Keel</p>
  </span>

      </figcaption>
    
  </figure>


                        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
        <div class="body--max-width">
      <div class="container title-body l-flex col">
        <h2 class="title">
  Eat, Drink &amp; Be Merry
</h2>
        <div class="body">  <span class="field--text-long">
    <p>River Street is lined with plenty of places to grab a tasty meal or ice-cold beer or cocktail. Enjoy a casual dining experience at <a href="https://brokenkeelsavannah.com/" target="_blank">Broken Keel</a>, for both signature and coastal mouth-watering classics. Grab a bite at <a href="/profile/vics-the-river/5030" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c3e00c48-24d3-4490-b8ac-6dc449d7b790" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Vic's On The River">Vic’s on the River</a>, <a href="/profile/olympia-cafe/5589" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="0d0225cf-ef95-4b87-8635-1d8cd7e7fe70" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Olympia Cafe">Olympia Café</a> or <a href="/profile/the-shrimp-factory/4851" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="6af83258-f017-41e6-acdf-1cfd753852a2" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="The Shrimp Factory">The Shrimp Factory</a> – just to name a few! Get an incredible bird's-eye view of the Savannah River by heading to one of River Street’s rooftop bars, like <a href="/profile/rocks-the-roof/4272" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="6a38289b-6079-4f90-95e1-5079d32b1727" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Rocks on the Roof">Rocks on the Roof</a> or <a href="/profile/top-deck/4879" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="d60d18e2-c158-4c4e-b933-79de7cfa513a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Top Deck">Top Deck</a>. And no River Street dining experience is complete without fresh beignets from <a href="/profile/hueys-restaurant/5867" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="85c76c51-1710-45f3-bcaf-5798ca2f3315" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Huey's Restaurant">Huey’s</a>!</p>

  </span>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
      
</div>

  <div class="paragraph--type--list">
      <div class="hero--max-width">
      <div class="container l-flex col">
        <div class="number-image l-flex row ">
          <div class="h1-xl number has-image scroll-reveal animate-pseudo-el">
            <span class="animate-fallback animate-fade-in">
  05
</span>
          </div>
          <div class="image">
  
        
  <figure class="media media-image carousel-slide ma-0 carousel-slide--view-mode media-caption media-location">

    <div class="square-aspect"></div>
      
    <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large_horizontal_wide/public/2024-02/View%20from%20River_riverboat.jpeg.webp?h=84071268&amp;itok=y6bFOCHA" width="1200" height="675" alt="View from River" class="image-style-large-horizontal-wide scale-with-grid" />




          <figcaption class="caption-basic text-align-right z-2">
          <span class="field--text-long">
    <p><span>View of River Street</span></p>
  </span>

      </figcaption>
    
  </figure>


                        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
        <div class="body--max-width">
      <div class="container title-body l-flex col">
        <h2 class="title">
  Cruise Along the Savannah River
</h2>
        <div class="body">  <span class="field--text-long">
    <p><a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ac52254d-a009-4781-b267-8abd37da2f24" href="/profile/savannah-riverboat-cruises/5989" title="Savannah Riverboat Cruises">Savannah Riverboat Cruises</a> sets sail from River Street multiple times a day. Savannah Riverboat Cruises offers plenty of cruise options, including daytime, late night, dinner, sightseeing and holiday cruises. You can even host your wedding on a Savannah Riverboat!&nbsp;</p>

  </span>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
      
</div>

  <div class="paragraph--type--list">
      <div class="hero--max-width">
      <div class="container l-flex col">
        <div class="number-image l-flex row ">
          <div class="h1-xl number has-image scroll-reveal animate-pseudo-el">
            <span class="animate-fallback animate-fade-in">
  06
</span>
          </div>
          <div class="image">
  

  <figure class="media media-image carousel-slide ma-0 carousel-slide--view-mode media-location">

    <div class="square-aspect"></div>
      
    <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large_horizontal_wide/public/river_street_ship_watching.jpg.webp?h=f2fcf546&amp;itok=PW2MCSKN" width="1200" height="675" alt="river-street-ship-watching.jpg" class="image-style-large-horizontal-wide scale-with-grid" />




    
  </figure>


                        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
        <div class="body--max-width">
      <div class="container title-body l-flex col">
        <h2 class="title">
  Soak up the View
</h2>
        <div class="body">  <span class="field--text-long">
    <p>River Street is the ultimate spot to sit back, relax and enjoy a gorgeous view of the Savannah River. River Street is also the ideal location&nbsp;for ship-watching – dozens of giant container ships pass by daily!</p>

  </span>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
      
</div>

